The next step should be integrating this foundation with LMLM's model runtime, checkpoint management, evaluation pipeline and hardware-aware execution.

**One important distinction:** the current implementation is a tested standalone PyTorch training package. It has not yet been integrated into or tested against an LMLM repository.
